  Ported from: hologram-ai archivum (content-addressed .holo archives)

  .holo archive format:
    - Manifest: JSON with tensor metadata, config, kappa hashes
    - Tensors: content-addressed by BLAKE3 hash (kappa)
    - Chunks: 1024-byte chunks, each hashed, Merkle tree
    - Ledger: append-only log of archive operations

